      "id": "concept:judgement",
      "logic_index": 1,
      "label": "判定",
      "definition": "All checks converge on the ordered d100 five-tier result language.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0001",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 1 | 判定 | d100 下掷五档，判定顺序＝灾难优先→卓越→成功→带代价→失败推进（vertical §1.4） | 技能/素质/对抗/战斗/追逐/侦查/无声击倒 全部走此节点；无第二套判定 ✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
        "source_sha256": "7ba536f1d235981b32a8a8f27c7429d6b53ead6daa4c0f3e82e465584a89f1b4",
        "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:time",
      "logic_index": 2,
      "label": "时间",
      "definition": "Mission time uses one timeline whose standard shift is thirty minutes.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0002",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 2 | 时间 | 任务时间轴，单位：1 班＝30 分钟 | 硬时限（D5）／巡逻班次（D3）／交接班窗口／反应窗口（管线）／侦查耗时（D1）／休整 共用同一轴与单位 ✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
        "source_sha256": "7ba536f1d235981b32a8a8f27c7429d6b53ead6daa4c0f3e82e465584a89f1b4",
        "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:exposure",
      "logic_index": 3,
      "label": "暴露",
      "definition": "One Task-scoped exposure counter advances patrol pressure and alarm accumulation.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0003",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 3 | 暴露 | 任务内暴露计数器（0 起） | 带代价成功／失败推进／开火(消音)／侦查带代价／无声击倒带代价／违规管线\"暴露\"段 全部 +1；效果唯一：推进巡逻时钟＋累积警报 ✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
        "source_sha256": "7ba536f1d235981b32a8a8f27c7429d6b53ead6daa4c0f3e82e465584a89f1b4",
        "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:short-term-cost-menu",
      "logic_index": 4,
      "label": "短期代价菜单",
      "definition": "Short-term costs are exposure, thirty minutes, one resource, or one stress.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0004",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 4 | 短期代价菜单 | {暴露+1, 时间+30min, 资源−1, 压力+1} | 带代价成功、侦查带代价、无声击倒等短期代价只从菜单选；**永久代价不在此列**（节点 5）✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
        "source_sha256": "7ba536f1d235981b32a8a8f27c7429d6b53ead6daa4c0f3e82e465584a89f1b4",
        "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "concept:permanent-cost",
      "logic_index": 5,
      "label": "永久代价",
      "definition": "The pollution track is the only campaign-permanent cost channel.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0005",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 5 | 永久代价 | 污染轨（0–10，污染条）——全战役永久代价唯一通道 | 违规严重度／逆转窗口②／实体接触／任务1 记名＝污染 1 格／任务2 记忆重写＝污染条(记忆型)／任务3 村民化＝污染条(身份型)／终局并入规则＝污染满格；失去记忆/身份/感官均表达为污染条 ✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
        "source_sha256": "7ba536f1d235981b32a8a8f27c7429d6b53ead6daa4c0f3e82e465584a89f1b4",
        "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL"
      }
    },
    {
