      "logic_index": 6,
      "label": "警报",
      "definition": "All alarm effects use the single zero-to-three alarm track.",
      "lifecycle_status": "PROPOSAL",
      "canonical": false,
      "invariant_ref": "UNR-INVARIANT-0006",
      "source": {
        "path": "campaign/rules/logic-map-v1.md",
        "locator": "| 6 | 警报 | 警报层级 0–3（唯一轨） | 开火/暴露计数/尸体 触发；封锁＝撤离 −20 状态减值（vertical §6.3.2＝fine D4）✓ |",
        "locator_type": "MARKDOWN_TABLE_ROW",
